    "updated_at": "2026-05-11T08:04:10Z",
    "body": "> I think Sanitizer essentially wants something like that? Not having equals for lists or maps at all probably won't work.\n\nSanitizer just needs to define equality for the SanitizerConfig dictionaries such as SanitizerElement, and then all the map/list algorithms (mainly contains) should refer to that. It doesn't need to deeply compare entire lists. ",
