    "body": "> I significantly reworked this as explained in the commit I added. I'm now happy with it. If this looks good to you as well Noam I can do some more work on ensuring we have PRs for the specifications that need changes as a result.\r\n> \r\n> I'm not 100% sure about giving structs and tuples different equality by default, but it does make sense I think.\r\n\r\nYea looks great! Thanks",
